% expect-output: true
% expect-output: [612 792]
% Scenario: unknown page-device keys are accepted and recorded.
% Expect: no error; TraySwitch reads back true; PageSize reads back.
<< /PageSize [612 792] /TraySwitch true >> setpagedevice
currentpagedevice /TraySwitch get ==   % true
currentpagedevice /PageSize get ==     % [612 792]
